{"id": "7th-t1-u2-219", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u1-amudhat-tamil", "lesson_id": "ta-l7-thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ilakkana-kurippu-poiyaadhu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கணக் குறிப்புத் தருக:\n'உள்ளத்தால் பொய்யாது ஒழுகின்' - இதில் 'பொய்யாது' என்னும் சொல்லின் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "எதிர்மறைப் பெயரெச்சம்", "B": "ஈறுகெட்ட எதிர்மறைப் பெயரெச்சம்", "C": "எதிர்மறை வினையெச்சம்", "D": "தொழிற்பெயர்"}, "explanation": "இலக்கண விதி: 'பொய்யாது' என்பது எதிர்மறைப் பொருளில் நின்று 'ஒழுகின்' என்னும் வினைச்சொல்லைக் கொண்டு முடிவதால் இது 'எதிர்மறை வினையெச்சம்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the grammatical category (Ilakkana Kurippu) of 'Poiyaadhu':"}], "options": {"A": "Edhirmarai Peyarecham", "B": "Eeruketta Edhirmarai Peyarecham", "C": "Edhirmarai Vinaiyecham (Negative adverbial participle)", "D": "Thozhirpeyar"}, "explanation": "Grammar rule: 'Poiyaadhu' is an incomplete negative verbal modifier modifying the action verb 'ozhugin', making it an Edhirmarai Vinaiyecham."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corpor